title: PhyloRecViewer
abstract: "Offline, interactive recPhyloXML / NHX phylogenetic-reconciliation
  viewer: gene trees embedded in species tube-maps, three-level nesting,
  event-level comparison, and vector export that reproduces the on-screen view."
